                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": true,
                    "src": "\\begin{array}{c}\\mathrm{Average}\\;\\mathrm{rate}\\;\\mathrm{of}\\;\\mathrm{change}\\;\\mathrm{of}\\;\\lbrack\\mathrm A\\rbrack\\;=\\;\\frac{\\triangle\\lbrack \\mathrm A\\rbrack}{\\triangle t}\\;=\\;\\frac{{\\lbrack\\mathrm A\\rbrack}_{\\mathrm f}\\;-\\;{\\lbrack\\mathrm A\\rbrack}_{\\mathrm i}\\;}{t_{\\mathrm f}\\;\\;-\\; t_{\\mathrm i}}\\\\=\\;\\frac{0.285\\;\\mathrm M\\;-\\;0.360\\;\\mathrm M}{25.0\\;\\mathrm s\\;-\\;20.0\\;\\mathrm s}\\;=\\;-\\frac{0.075\\;\\mathrm M}{5.0\\;\\mathrm s}\\; =\\;-0.015\\;\\mathrm{M/s}\\end{array}",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Note: Because A is a reactant, [A] decreases and Δ[A]/Δ"
